:- module(type_ref_arity_base, []).

% A base type takes no arguments. Applying one used to be accepted
% silently and surfaced later as a confusing tcon inconsistency at a
% distant use site; it is YCHR-60013 at the declaration now.
%
% The sibling directory `type_ref_arity_mismatch` covers the other
% shape, a *user* type referenced at the wrong arity — kept apart so
% that neither shape can satisfy the assertion on its own.
:- chr_type ibox ---> imk(int(A)).
